WHAT IS THE FUTURE OF AI?

- AI is being used in more ways every day. Streaming services make recommendations. In-home
    thermostats learn your preferences about how warm or cold you’d like your various rooms to be.
    Soon, microwaves will learn how you like to cook your food. AI helps you find hidden knowledge
    by discovering hidden patterns in unsorted, difficult to search data, like social media feeds,
    research publications, and medical records.

